name numerica-plus
category Package
revision 61289
shortdesc Iteration and recurrence relations: finding fixed points, zeros and extrema of functions
longdesc The package defines commands to iterate functions of a single
longdesc variable, find fixed points, zeros and extrema of such
longdesc functions, and calculate the terms of recurrence relations.
longdesc numerica-plus requires the package numerica, version 2, which
longdesc in turn requires l3kernel , l3packages, and the amsmath and
longdesc mathtools packages.
